3. Create a view for bus and staff details

SQL> CREATE VIEW bus_staff_view AS
  2  SELECT B.bus_id, B.reg_no, B.capacity,
  3         S.name AS staff_name, S.role
  4  FROM Bus B
  5  JOIN Staff S
  6  ON B.staff_id = S.staff_id;

View created.

