5. Create a view for passenger schedules

SQL> CREATE VIEW passenger_schedule_view AS
  2  SELECT P.name,
  3         S.schedule_id,
  4         S.travel_date,
  5         S.dept_time
  6  FROM Passenger P
  7  JOIN Booking B
  8  ON P.passenger_id = B.passenger_id
  9  JOIN Schedule S
 10  ON B.schedule_id = S.schedule_id;

View created.

